WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.996 --> 00:00:05.279
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:06.218
- [Voiceover] When I shop for clothes,

00:00:06.218 --> 00:00:07.476
I don't really look at it as

00:00:07.476 --> 00:00:09.140
a men's section and a women's section.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.804
I just shop the entire store.

00:00:10.804 --> 00:00:12.372
I just look for the things
that look cool on me,

00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:13.759
and fall well on me.

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:16.234
(upbeat music)

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:17.108
- [Voiceover] I think
in the modeling world,

00:00:17.108 --> 00:00:19.540
the reason why they chose
some androgynous-looking men

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.975
is because it makes it more
high fashion, more editorial.

00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:24.426
An androgynous guy is more striking.

00:00:24.426 --> 00:00:27.038
It draws attention from all types of eyes.

00:00:27.038 --> 00:00:29.342
(upbeat music)

00:00:29.342 --> 00:00:30.314
- [Voiceover] When I saw Ruby Rose,

00:00:30.314 --> 00:00:31.530
like, I was like, "You're a pretty woman,

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.161
"but like, if you were a guy,

00:00:33.161 --> 00:00:34.314
"you'd put on a leather jacket

00:00:34.314 --> 00:00:35.615
"with the tattoos and everything."

00:00:35.615 --> 00:00:37.258
I definitely think that's very sexy.

00:00:37.258 --> 00:00:39.252
(upbeat music)

00:00:39.252 --> 00:00:40.842
- [Voiceover] I identify as a woman,

00:00:40.842 --> 00:00:45.492
but I also totally accept
and love my masculine traits,

00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:47.380
as much as I love my feminine traits.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.759
(upbeat music)

00:00:49.759 --> 00:00:52.180
- [Voiceover] Androgyny is
definitely spicing things up.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.612
(upbeat music)

00:00:54.612 --> 00:00:55.369
- [Voiceover] I've just always

00:00:55.369 --> 00:00:56.586
been obsessed with David Bowie.

00:00:56.586 --> 00:00:59.391
He's always done that perfectly seamless

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:02.228
feminine to masculine,
masculine to feminine,

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.553
and he didn't care what
anyone thought about it.

00:01:04.553 --> 00:01:07.966
It was just so perfect and
amazing every time he did it.

00:01:07.966 --> 00:01:09.673
(upbeat music)

00:01:09.673 --> 00:01:10.525
- [Voiceover] As long as my hair is down,

00:01:10.525 --> 00:01:13.812
and I'm dressed with clothing
I like, I just feel good.

00:01:13.812 --> 00:01:15.722
(upbeat music)

00:01:15.722 --> 00:01:17.065
- It's kind of beautiful that

00:01:17.065 --> 00:01:18.420
we can all just be ourselves now,

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.850
and we can still have jobs

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.346
where you don't look like everyone else.

00:01:22.346 --> 00:01:24.415
- Someone so unapologetically themselves.

00:01:24.415 --> 00:01:27.060
I think that is the most
attractive thing in a person.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.526
(upbeat music)

00:01:36.758 --> 00:01:38.266
(squeaking)

